{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團IVE成員張員瑛向來是時尚界的寵兒，日前她在社交平台上載了一輯新相，其外貌與身材再度驚艷網民，瞬間引發網絡熱議。</p><figure><img alt=\"張員瑛牛仔Look。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151546174138748928084572.jpeg/lvV6ABxplDXFZtgYtBTvefI578fn71KwWXlktVl5ZLU\"/><figcaption>張員瑛牛仔Look。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><p>化身牛仔辣妹大騷九頭身完美比例</p><p>相片中可見，張員瑛身穿一套藍色牛仔短裝背心，下身配搭同款同色系的休閒牛仔長褲，將其招牌的「九頭身」逆天身材比例展露無遺。</p><figure><img alt=\"張員瑛比例驚人。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151546196846972928039415.jpeg/iYCHetn1g8OvTkcru9mABN1_toElnxhXFTnPrRU5z60\"/><figcaption>張員瑛比例驚人。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「九頭身」逆天身材。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151546193466232832219485.jpeg/XuFp2sGjiMntBeWVv5z3r-sPF-Kn5CjB7zlMG-85TBs\"/><figcaption>「九頭身」逆天身材。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><p>逆天馬甲線極吸睛</p><p>最讓網民移不開目光的，莫過於張員瑛在短版上衣下大方展露的極致身材。她不僅擁有令人羨慕的纖細腰身與零贅肉的細手臂，腹部更浮現出清晰可見的性感馬甲線，健康線條美感十足。大批網民紛紛湧入留言區大讚「太美啦」、「So beautiful」，驚嘆這完美的「人間芭比」身材簡直不真實！</p><figure><img alt=\"大騷性感馬甲線。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151546200265461760985634.jpeg/N_Dx2G98GU112inXRf7tMznZThVmJGZdqnL7F6py-xc\"/><figcaption>大騷性感馬甲線。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"纖細腰身。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151546204124352512490368.jpeg/TYm_nUAtS6i-6LFVpMbbaDPdNotbzqutjI1n8IyNZ_A\"/><figcaption>纖細腰身。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張員瑛（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151546189435375616586702.jpeg/SDOD9CSXmbo8lFLoH9W9lb63uieXuXv8gzELooMxC6I\"/><figcaption>張員瑛（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-12T06:16:50.058772+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":453,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}